{"items":[{"id":"1295440779314417664","title":"如果我是拜登，这时候最好也顺水推舟也“…","content":"<p>如果我是拜登，这时候最好也顺水推舟也“感染”上新冠，这样就能找回场子，但毕竟这玩意假的容易被戳穿，真的可能扛不住。&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;两难。</p>","excerpt":"如果我是拜登，这时候最好也顺水推舟也“…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":8,"created":1601637149,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1295440779314417664"},{"id":"1295413457706323968","title":"还是说说吧，别太在意了","content":"<p>还是说说吧，别太在意了。&lt;br&gt;资本市场的剧烈博弈已经暂时过去了，现在的博弈完全属于政治。&lt;br&gt;懂王连任，新冠算得上什么？&lt;br&gt;懂王不连任，新冠又算得上什么？&lt;br&gt;政治人物永远考虑会是如何利用一些因素，关进你是要看懂王如何围绕新冠做文章了。</p>","excerpt":"还是说说吧，别太在意了","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":1,"created":1601630635,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1295413457706323968"},{"id":"1295411424210808832","title":"一觉醒来，世界都变了，但最有意思的还是…","content":"<p>一觉醒来，世界都变了，但最有意思的还是某人这句话：&lt;br&gt;得新冠者得天下。</p>","excerpt":"一觉醒来，世界都变了，但最有意思的还是…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":8,"created":1601630151,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1295411424210808832"},{"id":"1294361688087818240","title":"邀请我的人绝对是个鬼才","content":"<p>邀请我的人绝对是个鬼才。</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-357fbfea37377d36295046af54f9755d_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"748\" height=\"845\">","excerpt":"邀请我的人绝对是个鬼才","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":13,"created":1601379874,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1294361688087818240"},{"id":"1294162373423239168","title":"四个被冻结账户不到一万块，这种冻结我是…","content":"<p>四个被冻结账户不到一万块，这种冻结我是真没想到，可能这就是资本市场吧。</p><img src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-611992ee40efc349bae9fd0053ab521d_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"749\" height=\"834\">","excerpt":"四个被冻结账户不到一万块，这种冻结我是…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":12,"created":1601332354,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1294162373423239168"},{"id":"1293898324232359936","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-f3320304c97c14df6aef126ef87240f7_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"719\" height=\"800\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":23,"created":1601269399,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1293898324232359936"},{"id":"1293319792535896064","title":"国家想发展科技（没钱）----搞个科创板--…","content":"<p>国家想发展科技（没钱）----搞个科创板-----各大投资公司进去预热，把场子弄得正规一点------发新股，配合上市收费然后买股-----抬高股价------放松进入限制----股民进入-----开始抛售找人接盘----接盘人数不够------创设基金帮忙接盘-  - - -一地鸡毛股民遭殃。</p>","excerpt":"国家想发展科技（没钱）----搞个科创板--…","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":16,"created":1601131467,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1293319792535896064"},{"id":"1293216566814101504","title":"重点是评论区....","content":"<p>重点是评论区....</p><a class=\"LinkCard\" href=\"https://www.zhihu.com/question/394637216/answer/1482730079\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><b>年薪百万是什么感觉？</b></a>","excerpt":"重点是评论区....","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":6,"created":1601106856,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1293216566814101504"},{"id":"1292543485321920512","title":"我对恒大的信任完全来自于恒大造车","content":"<p>我对恒大的信任完全来自于恒大造车。</p><img src=\"https://pic4.zhimg.com/50/v2-863055ccafae9eadcf0256c60ee5351b_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"748\" height=\"331\">","excerpt":"我对恒大的信任完全来自于恒大造车","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":7,"created":1600946381,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1292543485321920512"},{"id":"1292464337127370752","title":"[想法的图片]","content":"<img src=\"https://pic2.zhimg.com/50/v2-5fe2bf5c6b024ad03876aee8d5bb50bc_qhd.jpg\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" alt=\"\" width=\"1080\" height=\"1440\">","excerpt":"[想法的图片]","voteupCount":0,"commentCount":4,"created":1600927510,"url":"https://www.zhihu.com/pin/1292464337127370752"}]}